  "id": "slow-cooker-pork-chops-with-tomato-pepper-sauce",
  "name": "Slow Cooker Pork Chops with Tomato-Pepper Sauce",
  "subtitle": "Tender pork chops in a tangy tomato sauce",
  "description": "Browned pork chops slow-cooked with onion, green peppers, and a lightly sweetened tomato sauce, then finished with a thickened gravy.",
  "meal_type": "main",
  "cuisine": "American",
  "yield": {
    "quantity": 5,
